                  "Title": "Orchard Core Videos tool"
                },
                "TextAndImage": {
                  "Body": {
                    "Html": "<p>Orchard Core Videos is an internal tool for maintainers of the Orchard Core project. It is used to upload and manage the project's own videos on its YouTube channel. It is not a public service, and no accounts or sign-ups are offered to the public.</p>"
